  "ruleText": "Env-A 607.04 Review Criteria. The department shall review each application for a temporary permit to ensure compliance with:\n\n(a) All applicable elements of the SIP;\n\n(b) Env-A 100 et seq.;\n\n(c) Applicable state law governing air pollution; and\n\n(d) Applicable requirements, as defined in Env-A 102.\n\nSource. #1375, eff 7-1-79; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; amd by #6780, eff 6-27-98, EXPIRES: 10-25-98; amd by #6813, eff 7-23-98; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
